    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      172.39,
      516.77,
      397.23,
      556.55
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the addition, immediately after the renumberedsubsection (1) thereof, the following newsubsection:\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      193.15,
      573.53,
      397.18,
      670.07
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(2) Upon the demise of a testator in a joint lastwill, testamentary proceedings shall be institutedunder Chapter XXXVIII or Chapter XXXVIIIB ofthe Civil Procedure Code (Chapter 101), as the casemay be, to obtain the probate or letters ofadministration with the will annexed proving thewill.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
